        "schemaType": "fromJson",
        "jsonSchemaExample": "[\n  {\n    \"isim\": \"Doctor Name (e.g. Prof. Dr. Ercan Bıçakcı)\",\n    \"uzmanlik\": \"Medical Specialty (e.g. Cardiology)\",\n    \"fotograf_url_adresi\": \"/assets/doctors/photo.jpg (CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Extract the exact URL of the doctor's portrait photograph. You must deeply search inside 'data-src', 'data-lazy', or 'src' attributes. Do NOT extract UI icons, button graphics, or ANY file ending in '.svg' such as 'hizli-randevu-icon.svg'. If you cannot find a .jpg, .jpeg, or .png portrait image, you MUST leave this field completely empty. NEVER return an SVG file.)\"\n  }\n]",
